adquarters","x":1071.5,"y":1245.13,"cell":30067,"i":293,"name":"Hearthamer Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ፈፐሰተፀቀለከሀረ  ደጠፀጠሐሐተጠሠዐነበረኀለየሰበከ ነአአለሰጠሰየቀደረበሀነቀረፀሠቀፈአፀረ ረ ሀ ሐደአጰ ፈ ረተጠደነወኀ</div>"},{"icon":"🗿","type":"cartel headquarters","x":1581.39,"y":208.03,"cell":4262,"i":294,"name":"Frostmender Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢤᠰᢋᢠᡲᢏᠳᢜᡎᢏᢁᢏᢥᡭᠳᢀᢥᠰᡔᡏ᠒ᠽ᠐ᡆᢞᡜᢁᢡᡒᡙᠭᡁᡍᡐᠲᢞ᠀ᢦᠼᠩᡐᢋᠠᢜᢟᠿᡜᡐᡙᡀᢛᠾᠮᢠᠩᢞᠻᡍᡗᠿᢓᠿᡑ</div>"},{"icon":"🗿","type":"cartel headquarters","x":2694.79,"y":688.41,"cell":16303,"i":295,"name":"Scutabi Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> ዘ ኀየዐሐቀሀበከጠሐኀቀ ጠበከበ ሰሰ ወየደ ወ ገሀሐዐቀ ሀሰፈ ወደሠወሐዐዘሀተዘዘመ  ዐሐጰነየወዐዐደ ሰገሐደ ኀመከ ነሰደሐረፀ ዐከጸከፀዐጠዐፀበጰ</div>"},{"icon":"🗿","type":"cartel headquarters","x":1662.47,"y":322.79,"cell":7001,"i":296,"name":"Canopybre Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ጠ ፐየፀለወበ ሐዘጰተተበዐተሀ ዐለወ  ረፈነገሰፐሀፀ ጰከበጠለፈከፐመ ጸገገፀአጸጠደ ዐተዐጰቀሀነሐፈጰነ ከየለፈቀ</div>"},{"icon":"🗿","type":"cartel headquarters","x":972.46,"y":1133.15,"cell":27276,"i":297,"name":"Inoushout Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⲴⳐⳄⳫⳘⳞⳚⳆⳆⳄⳄⳠ⳹ⳤ⳾ⳒⳆⳒⳐⳘⳬⳖ⳥ⳔⲺⲸⲶⲲ⳹⳾ⳐⳤⳖ⳪ⲶⳔⳲ⳥ⳤ⳾ⳞⳤⲸⳄⳆⳐⳀ⳧Ⲿ⳩ⲾⳖ</div>"},{"icon":"🗿","type":"cartel headquarters","x":882.91,"y":1416.42,"cell":33980,"i":298,"name":"Hearthrob Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༘༽་༽༚༉༰༕༲༰༯༨༑༤༊༼༿༑༣༨༻༳་༒༆༿༗༹༱༵༧༴༵༙༠༫ༀ༰༐༓</div>"},{"icon":"🗿","type":"cartel headquarters","x":1846.26,"y":281.18,"cell":6034,"i":299,"name":"Cadebrecal Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳹ⳚⳬⳜ⳥ⲶⳠⳤⳄ ⳀⳌ⳹⳩Ⳣ⳩ⳚⲼⳈⳎⲾⳫⳫⳐⳎⳤⳆⳒⳔⳭⳌⳀ ⳊⳎⳒⳬ⳩ⳃ⳹ⳈⳀⳖⲲⲲⳃ⳪ⲼⳂⲶⳈⳆⳊ ⳾Ⳁ</div>"},{"icon":"🗿","type":"cartel headquarters","x":2072.17,"y":670.73,"cell":15714,"i":300,"name":"Mon Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳇⳁ⳧ⳌⳌ⳥ⳚⳃⳂⲸⳤⳒⲼⳚⳢⲶⳀⳎ⳹ⳌⳀⳖ⳧ⳬⳄⳖ⳪ⳆⳘⳤⲲⳄ⳾⳹ⳊⳄⲸ⳪ⳤⲺ ⳥ⳔⳌⳈⳒⳘ⳥Ⳇ ⳩Ⳓ⳥ⲺⳚⳲⳠⳈⳄⳭ⳥Ⲷ ⳖⳘⲶ⳥ⳤⳚⲴ⳥ⲼⲼⳎ Ⲻ</div>"},{"icon":"🗿","type":"cartel headquarters","x":1126.01,"y":1279.43,"cell":31034,"i":301,"name":"Heartpactfor Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">በወሀደመገሀዘ  ተ የዘሠመዘዘ ፐበተጠጠረሠገሀገጠጰቀሰወወጠሠከሀነከበተፐሐበሰየበሰየሠጸዘ ጠከኀሀየ ሀፐነዐፈጠሠጠዐጠሰ ኀከጰየሀዐ በ ጠ ወየገሰ</div>"},{"icon":"🗿","type":"cartel headquarters","x":2598.47,"y":324.4,"cell":7089,"i":302,"name":"Grorath Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc1c\ud802𐠜\udc11𐠯\udc02\udc38\udc25\udc33\udc15\udc2a \udc0e\udc12𐠸\udc2e\udc0f𐠨\udc16\ud802𐠐\ud802𐠊𐠈\udc04  𐠜\ud802\ud802𐠵\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠬</div>"},{"icon":"🗿","type":"cartel headquarters","x":798.41,"y":245.87,"cell":5194,"i":303,"name":"Blod Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc37\udc27\udc29\udc20\udc26\udc05𐠦\udc02\udc31\udc02\udc18\udc11\udc0b\udc1c\udc2f𐠚𐠷𐠰\udc2d\udc25\ud802𐠢\udc12\ud802𐠖\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc17\udc31\ud802𐠡\udc35\ud802𐠁\udc1e\ud802 \udc03\udc1b\ud802𐠃𐠥\udc27\ud802𐠸\udc1e\udc3c\udc35\udc0b\ud802𐠃\udc26\udc34\udc05\udc26𐠕\udc2b𐠐𐠎𐠂\ud802\ud802 \udc05𐠮\udc11\udc2e</div>"},{"icon":"🗿","type":"cartel headquarters","x":2689.28